 {
  "verse_id": "tsa-a05-v04",
  "song": "tsa-a05",
  "verse": 4,
  "quick_english": "Here the fitting meditation is taught: the self-luminous supreme tattva contained in all tattvas — meditating it in own-heart-knowing, let him meditate the union of knower-instrument-known, the fire-sun-moon triad, until he becomes great-Bhairava-fire, meditation-wind-fanned. From its wheel wrapped by twelve old power-flames, emerging by some pore-door, let him contemplate it having rested in the external graspable-self; by that rested one, first filled external by moon-form in creation-order, then illuminated by sun-form, then dissolved by dissolution-fire, then caused unsurpassable-selfhood — let him meditate.",
